
<div id="urduTextPath">شہزادی سکینہ (ص)/بانو سے دمبدم یہ سکینہ کا تھا بیاں</div>
<p>baano se dam-ba dam ye sakina ka tha bayaa'n<br />
kaisa makaan hai ke hawaa tak nahi jahaa'n<br />
dekhoongi kis tarha se bhala shakl -e aasmaa'n<br />
hae hae zameen tak nazar aati nahi yahaa'n</p>

<p>amma sabho'n ki jaan quda hi bachaayega<br />
shab ko bhi kya charaagh jalaya na jaayega<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aisi hi teeragi hai to bas ho chuki hayaat<br />
mai jaanti hoo'n aaj ki shab ko shab-e wafaat<br />
sote the leke seene pa baba tamaam raat<br />
aadat meri bigaad gaye shaah-e qush sifaat</p>

<p>jab shamma gul huwi hai to ghabraake royi hoo'n<br />
amma bhala kabhi mai andhere me soye hoo'n<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>maa beti me yahaa'n thi gham angez daastaa'n<br />
aayi paher ke bajne ki aawaaz naagahaa'n<br />
hushyaar bhaaiyo ye pukaare nigaahbaa'n<br />
bhaage aseer to na bachegi kisi ki jaa'n</p>

<p>tadpe dil aur habs jo deh chand hogaya<br />
zindaa'n ka dar lahad ki tarha band hogaya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>chillayi jald utt ke sakina ghazab huva<br />
maa ne gale lagaake kahaa shukr ki hai jaa<br />
qurbaan jaau dil ko sambhaalo paye khuda<br />
dekho guzar gayi hai paher raat mai fidaa</p>

<p>ab to bani huvi hai quda par nazar karo<br />
taa subhaa jis tarhaa se ho beti basar karo<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tadbeere maa ne ki paye taskee'n ajab ajab<br />
us raat ki tarha se badha dam-ba dam ta'ab<br />
rone me katgayi jo sakina ko nisf shab<br />
naachaar hoke godh me leti wo qush laqab</p>

<p>susti kamaal qaatir-e naazuk pa chaagayi<br />
baate'n jo maa ne ki to zaraa neend aagayi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>soyi thi koi dam ke bandha aansuo'n ka taar<br />
dekha ye qaab aaye hai sultaan-e naamdaar<br />
phailaaye haath dhoondti utthi wo dilfigaar<br />
jhuk jhuk ke dekhti thi har ek simt baar baar</p>

<p>kehti thi hai ghazab ka andhera ziyaa nahi<br />
baba kidhar khade ho mujhe soojhta nahi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>the sab haram yateem ki baato pe nouhagar<br />
rote the paasbaan bhi mu dhaanp dhaanp kar<br />
naagah gayi yazeed ko is haal ki qabar<br />
machli huwi hai duqtar-e sultan-e behrobar</p>

<p>faryaad kar rahi hai ajab izteraar hai<br />
baba ko dekhne ke liye beqaraar hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>lejaao farq-e shaah ye bola siyaah rooh<br />
lekar sar-e hussain rawaana huwe adoo<br />
thi raah me chamak sar-e anwar ki chaar soo<br />
zindaa'n ke paas jaake jo di gesuo'n ne boo</p>

<p>saidaaniyo'n me hashr huwa saff ulat gayi<br />
zindaa'n ke dar se aake sakina lipat gayi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qush qush khadi huwi thi sakina lagaaye aas<br />
itne me waa'n huwa jo dar aayi gulo'n ki baas<br />
phaili ziyaa-e husn-e shahinshaah-e haq shinaas<br />
roushan huwa makaan jo muddat se tha udaas</p>

<p>doude haram hussain ki tasleem ke liye<br />
sajjad uth khade huwe taazeem ke liye<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baithi zamee'n pa leke sakina sar-e imaam<br />
mu rakh ke mu pa qoob kiye uns ke kalaam<br />
ghash aagaya ke laayi qazaa maut ka payaam<br />
lipti sar-e pidar se khinchi sab rage'n tamaam</p>

<p>tha mu pe mu ke zeest ka naqshaa badal gaya<br />
hichki bas ek aayi wahin dam nikal gaya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kurta uthaa ke seene ko dene lagi hawa<br />
zainab se ki ye arz ke padhiye koi duaa<br />
sajjad se kahaa ke idhar aao mai fidaa<br />
beta bahen ki nabz to dekho maraz hai kya</p>

<p>chounka rahe hai sab qabar-e dasto paa nahi<br />
ghash me kabhi ye haal kisi ka sunaa nahi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>dekhi jo nabz rone lage aabid-e hazee'n<br />
maa ne kaha tadap ke mujhe taab ab nahi<br />
jo haal hai quda ke liye keh chuko kahee'n<br />
sajjad sar jhuka ke ye bole ke margayi</p>

<p>takleef dijiye na tan-e paash paash ko<br />
jaldi litaaiye ke aziyaat hai laash ko<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sadqe gayi huwa is andhere me inteqaal<br />
beti ye daagh dil se na jaayega maah o saal<br />
fizza ne paas baanou se jaakar kiya sawaal<br />
dedo koi charaagh to ehsaan hai kamaal</p>

<p>ho roushni ye rasm hai saare jahaan me<br />
mayyat padi huwi hai andhere makaan me<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>